{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-108-1","title":"Psalms 108:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David encourages himself to praise God. 5 He prays for God's assistance according to his promise. 11 His confidence in God's help.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2964. B.C. 1040. (Title.)This Psalm is composed of two Psalms; ver. 1-5 being the same as Ps 57:7-11; and ver. 6-13 the same as Ps 60:5-12; and it is probably to be referred to the same period as the latter.</p>\n<p>68:1; *title my heart. 57:7-11 I will. 30:12; 34:1; 104:33; 138:1; 145:1,2; 146:1,2; Ex 15:1 my glory. 16:9; 71:8,15,23,24; 145:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-2","title":"Psalms 108:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Awake. 33:2; 69:30; 81:2; 92:1-4; Jud 5:12 I myself. 57:8; 103:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-3","title":"Psalms 108:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>praise. 22:22,27; 96:10; 117:1; 138:4,5; Zep 3:14,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-4","title":"Psalms 108:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>thy mercy. 36:5; 85:10; 89:2,5; 103:11; Isa 55:9; Mic 7:18-20; Eph 2:4-7 clouds. or, skies.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-5","title":"Psalms 108:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Be thou. 8:1; 21:13; 57:5,11; 148:13; 1Ch 29:10-13 thy glory. 72:19; Isa 6:3; Mt 6:9,10,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-6","title":"Psalms 108:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>That thy. 60:5-12; De 33:12; 2Sa 12:25; Mt 3:17; 17:5; Ro 1:7; Eph 1:6 Col 3:12 save. 35:1-3; 54:1; 98:1,2; 144:5-7; Ex 15:6; Isa 51:2-11 and answer me. 1Ki 18:24,26,29,36,37; 2Ch 32:20-22; Isa 65:24; Jer 33:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-7","title":"Psalms 108:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>spoken. 89:35,36; Am 4:2 I will rejoice. 16:9-11; 2Sa 7:20-29; 1Pe 1:3,8; 2Pe 1:3,4 Shechem. Jos 17:7; 20:7; 24:1 the valley. Ge 33:17; Jud 8:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-8","title":"Psalms 108:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Gilead. Jos 13:8-11; 2Sa 2:8; 5:5 Ephraim. De 33:17; 1Sa 28:4 Judah. 122:5; Ge 49:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-9","title":"Psalms 108:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Moab. 60:8-10; 2Sa 8:1,2; Joh 13:8,14 I cast. Ru 4:7,8 over Philistia. 2Sa 21:15-22; Isa 14:29-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-10","title":"Psalms 108:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>who will lead. 20:6-8; 60:1; *title Isa 63:1-6; Jer 49:7-16; Ob 1:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-11","title":"Psalms 108:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>who hast. 44:9; 1Sa 29:1-31:13 go forth. Nu 10:9; De 20:3,4; 1Sa 17:26,36; 2Ch 13:12; 14:11; 20:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-12","title":"Psalms 108:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Give. 20:1-9 for vain. 146:3-5; Job 9:13; 16:2; Isa 2:22; 30:3-5; 31:3; Jer 17:5-8; La 4:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-108-13","title":"Psalms 108:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":108,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":108,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Through. 18:29-34; 118:6-13; 144:1; 2Ch 20:12; 1Co 15:10; Eph 6:10-18 tread. 18:42; 60:12; Jud 15:8; Isa 25:10; 63:3; Ro 16:20; 2Co 2:14</p>"}]}